# infra#1113 (owner ruling 2026-09-27): never download onnxruntime-node's GPU
# (CUDA/TensorRT) execution providers. On linux/x64 its postinstall otherwise
# fetches the ~238 MB Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime.Gpu.Linux NuGet package on
# every `npm ci`/`npm install` that recreates node_modules, over a metered
# line. No WRFCoin host has a GPU. The CPU runtime ships inside the npm
# package. npm exports this key to install scripts as
# npm_config_onnxruntime_node_install, which onnxruntime-node reads.
# Guarded by __tests__/onnxruntime-gpu-download-skip.test.ts.
onnxruntime-node-install=skip
